message: "If you use this software or the accompanying report, please cite it as below."
title: "Automated Bladder Cancer Screening using Vision Transformer (ViT)"
authors:
  - family-names: "Gajjar"
    given-names: "Pratik Nileshkumar"
    affiliation: "California State University, Dominguez Hills"
type: software
license: MIT
year: 2026
url: "https://github.com/pg2397/bladder-cancer-vit"
abstract: >-
  A Vision Transformer pipeline that segments urine cytology images into
  background, cytoplasm and nucleus, and computes per-cell
  nucleus-to-cytoplasm (N/C) ratios. The model matches an experienced
  cytopathologist on ranking cells by severity (Spearman r = 0.855 vs 0.851).
  This repository accompanies a CSUDH M.S. Computer Science Master's Project
  report with industry mentorship from Cedars-Sinai Medical Center.
